; Tabitha, sketch F "Minuet of Ice": C minor, 3/4, 112 bpm. An aristocratic minuet: a harp states the cold hook, strings play open fifths on beats two and three, a low horn holds the harmony, plucked bass and rim-and-kick kit; a flat ninth (Ab over G7) for the cruelty. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
